  "notes": [
    "Created via Kibana Dashboards API (kibana-dashboards skill).",
    "Panels use dataView ID 18dd83e8-6f88-474f-b434-a4b6c14a04a2 (metrics-gamepulse.* wildcard).",
    "17 panels: 3 filter controls, 6 summary metric tiles, FPS timeline, frame time with p95/p99 overlays, stutter area chart, GPU util/temp, GPU power/VRAM, CPU util/temp, memory timeline, session config table.",
    "gamepulse.fps.stutter_count is a TSDS counter — uses MAX (never avg/sum).",
    "gamepulse.compatibility.proton_version is the correct field (not gamepulse.game.proton_version which does not exist).",
    "gamepulse.hardware.gpu.driver_version and .model confirmed present in session stream.",
    "All field paths validated via ES|QL before building."
  ],
  "schema_notes": [
    "API schema deviations from skill docs (verified 2026-04-06/07):",
    "- options_list_control: use field_name (not field), data_view_id (snake_case)",
    "- xy terms x-axis: no 'size' property allowed",
    "- breakdown_by terms: use {operation:'terms', fields:[...]} (no size)",
    "- datatable: type is 'data_table' (not 'datatable'), rows terms has no size",
    "- esql dataset type: not supported in dashboard API inline panels; use index or dataView",
    "- Multiple y operations in a single XY layer are supported"
  ],
